  "content": "<h1>Aimz - 狙擊 RPG 準星</h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">概要</span></p><p>專為我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>模組包設計的自訂準星，現以獨立形式發布。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">描述</span></p><p>此模組將原版標準準星替換為狙擊與射擊風格準星，進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗，特別適合搭配弓與弩使用，同時也可應用於遊戲中的其他場景。</p><p><br>尋找更多準星、字體或資源包？請查看我的其他專案<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/658/682/2023-05-09_01.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"442\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器，與朋友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用代碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
